Contains information from Open Food Facts, Open Beauty Facts, Open Products Facts and
Open Pet Food Facts (https://world.openfoodfacts.org), made available under the
Open Database License (ODbL) 1.0.

The files in data/off/ are a copy of that information. The rows in data/products.csv and the
combined catalog built from both are released under the same licence.

